      "content": "wait i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. if i just do the cool water thing, can i just put a thick layer of coconut oil or even some antibiotic ointment on it once it cools down? i read online that oils help lock in the moisture so it heals faster.",
